Tue Sep 22 12:50:57 UTC 2026 - Yunhe Guo <i@guoyunhe.me>

- Initial package of the anura engine, version 4.0.0~git20260430, split
  out of frogatto
- Install the engine's own game data (data, images, music) and the
  modules it bundles (gui, icons, lib_2d) below /usr/share/anura
- Add an /usr/bin/anura wrapper: the engine resolves data/, images/ and
  modules/ relative to the current directory and uses that directory as
  its built-in "core" module, so it has to be started from the data
  directory.  The engine binary itself moved to /usr/libexec/anura/anura

